---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Contribute research">
  <Hero><span>Contribute research</span></Hero>
  <article class="col-span-full bg-background-primary p-[var(--grid-display-size)] shadow-border body-text body-text--constrain-width" data-pagefind-body>
    <p>The inventory lives in version-controlled JSON under <code>src/data</code>. Contributions should add primary evidence, preserve exact source names, and use <code>unknown</code> rather than guessing when documentation is silent.</p>
    <h2>Minimum evidence</h2>
    <ul><li>Documentation or source URL</li><li>Version or pinned commit when available</li><li>Retrieval date</li><li>Verified, inferred, or unknown status for every behavioral claim</li></ul>
    <h2>Validation</h2>
    <p>Run <code>npm run validate:data</code> for reference integrity and <code>npm run build</code> for schema validation and the production site build.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
